/-!
# Global roles of the complex network and the invocation maps

Data roles (`W = 2N + 2vR`): `X(a,b)`, `Y(a,b)` (`a, b < v`), `A1(b,q)`, `A2(a,q)` (`q < R`).
Temporaries (`T = 48v + N`): `M1(b,j)`, `M2(a,j)` (`j < 24`), `τ(a,b)`.

`ι1 b` maps the local wires of stage-one invocation `b` (`x_t ↦ X(t,b)`, `y_S ↦ Y(S,b)`,
`a_q ↦ A1(b,q)`, `m_j ↦ M1(b,j)`), `ι2 a` those of stage-two invocation `a`
(`x_b ↦ Y(a,b)`, `y_S ↦ X(a,S)`, `a_q ↦ A2(a,q)`, `m_j ↦ M2(a,j)`). `g0`: the initial labels.
-/

